# Project Skills

`.agents/skills/` is the Cursor skills source of truth. `.github/skills/` mirrors it for GitHub Copilot — keep both in sync when adding or changing skills.

Read the relevant `SKILL.md` before specialized work. Available skills:

| Skill | Use when |
|-------|----------|
| `framework-selection` | Starting LangChain/LangGraph/Deep Agents work |
| `langchain-dependencies` | Package versions and dependency setup |
| `langchain-fundamentals` | Building LangChain agents |
| `langchain-middleware` | HITL middleware and custom middleware |
| `langchain-rag` | RAG ingestion, retrieval, vector stores |
| `langgraph-fundamentals` | StateGraph, nodes, edges, streaming |
| `langgraph-persistence` | Checkpointers, thread_id, Store |
| `langgraph-human-in-the-loop` | interrupt(), approval workflows |
| `langgraph-cli` | langgraph dev/build/deploy |
| `langgraph-case-triage-slice` | Case triage walking skeleton |
| `deep-agents-core` | Deep Agents harness |
| `deep-agents-memory` | StateBackend, StoreBackend, filesystem |
| `deep-agents-orchestration` | Subagents, planning, HITL |
| `managed-deep-agents` | LangSmith managed deep agents API |
| `new-org-tenant-onboarding` | Org and tenant onboarding |
| `salesforce-case-create` | Create a realistic Salesforce Case for testing/demos |
| `salesforce-node4-parts-prep` | Phase 4-Pre Node 4 inventory metadata deploy, backfill, validation |
| `railway-quick-deploy` | Deploy current workspace changes to Railway |
| `swarm` | Parallel fan-out workflows |

Do not use external `npx skills` setup when a repo skill exists.
